# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-24 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This guide demonstrates basic usage of the Constrained Quantum Optimizer by showing how to load the function and execute simple problems. For a more involved tutorial, see [Find the Maximum Independent Set with the Aqarios Constrained Quantum Optimizer](/tutorials/find-the-maximum-independent-set-with-aqarios-constrained-quantum-optimizer).\n"
msgstr "מדריך זה מדגים שימוש בסיסי ב-Constrained Quantum Optimizer, על ידי הצגת אופן טעינת הפונקציה והרצת בעיות פשוטות. למדריך מפורט יותר, ראו [Find the Maximum Independent Set with the Aqarios Constrained Quantum Optimizer](/tutorials/find-the-maximum-independent-set-with-aqarios-constrained-quantum-optimizer).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-24 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Authenticate with your IBM Quantum API key and instance CRN, then load the function from the catalog.\n"
